            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "В юности он играл на гитаре. V yúnosti on igrál na gitáre. In his youth he played the guitar."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine. Roughly the years from fifteen to twenty."
            }
